; Stops: none inside a node with (stops none); a node of an undefined
; kind has the stops of text, but typing goes outside it where it can,
; and edits inside it are refused while deleting it whole is not. A
; block's end after its last line break is no stop.
> (buffers:define-kind passed (inline) (stops none))
